\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X),\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ID}}(\\vec X),\\mathrm{ID}_1(\\vec X)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ee9a93363bcae359\" href=\"?note=ee9a93363bcae359\" title=\"18-df-id1\">18-df-id1</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in,\\mathrm{KP}_\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in,\\mathrm{KP}_\\omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e391b202f09e2f43\" href=\"?note=e391b202f09e2f43\" title=\"18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory\">18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D(\\vec X),\\iota_E,\\iota_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal D(\\vec X),\\iota_E,\\iota_\\in\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6d3242aa1837d0b9\" href=\"?note=6d3242aa1837d0b9\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-realization\">18-df-arithmetic-realization</a> 的明确语法域与实现；一阶显示符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i\">\\(X_i\\)</span> 使用上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(X_i)\">\\(r(X_i)\\)</span> 约定。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|,\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\Pi^1_1}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|,\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\Pi^1_1}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2053b1b724a60f4e\" href=\"?note=2053b1b724a60f4e\" title=\"18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a> 的带实现理论呈示与一般良基 PR 关系秩口径。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak K\">\\(\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak K\\)</span> 从现行概念入口导入；比较不依赖未展开的“标准集合论解释”。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BH}\">\\(\\mathrm{BH}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3cb367216d9bd61d\" href=\"?note=3cb367216d9bd61d\" title=\"18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal\">18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal</a>。 下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak K\">\\(\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X},\\mathfrak K\\)</span> 直接使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"6b282f1972a35fb5\" href=\"?note=6b282f1972a35fb5\" title=\"18-thm-id1-kp-ordinal\">18-thm-id1-kp-ordinal</a> 所定义的同一呈示，不在本文件再次定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\|\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X}\\|=\\|\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X}\\|_{\\Pi^1_1}=\\mathrm{BH}=\\|\\mathfrak K\\|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\|\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X}\\|=\\|\\mathfrak I_{\\vec X}\\|_{\\Pi^1_1}=\\mathrm{BH}=\\|\\mathfrak K\\|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件名以兼容已有入口，结论与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"6b282f1972a35fb5\" href=\"?note=6b282f1972a35fb5\" title=\"18-thm-id1-kp-ordinal\">18-thm-id1-kp-ordinal</a> 一致。源页码和证明审阅状态沿用原记录；本轮没有新增原书页码核验或证明助理验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-id1","status":"resolved","id":"ee9a93363bcae359","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-id1]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory","status":"resolved","id":"e391b202f09e2f43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"3cb367216d9bd61d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-bachmann-howard-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2053b1b724a60f4e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-realization","status":"resolved","id":"6d3242aa1837d0b9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","locatio